{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authenticationCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"– a code obtained from the backend Sentiance API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"authenticationCode"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accepts an authentication code, which will be used to create a linked Sentiance user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The supplied authentication code is used to find the app user to link to during the user creation process. Therefore,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before calling this method, make sure that you have obtained a valid code from the backend Sentiance API. This code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request is authenticated using a Sentiance API key, which must never be transmitted to the app. Hence why the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must come from your backend."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Initiate an authentication code request via your backend towards the Sentiance backend. This request will include","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your app’s user identifier, which will be temporarily coupled to the code that you will receive.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrieve the code in your app and supply it to this initializer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Build and pass a SENTUserCreationOptions object containing this code to createUserWithOptions:completionHandler:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to create a linked user. If the authentication code references an app user that exists on the Sentiance Platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(i.e. an app user identifier that was previously supplied to Sentiance), its corresponding Sentiance user will be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restored on this device. Any other SDK instance with this user will then get disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(authenticationcode:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(authenticationcode:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"text":"initWithAuthenticationCode:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authenticationCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"init(authenticationCode:)","externalID":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserCreationOptions(im)initWithAuthenticationCode:","modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","symbolKind":"init"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions\/init(authenticationCode:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.sentiance.SENTSD